          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the rapid east-to-west movement of a green light in the sky of the Antilles: probable atmospheric reentry of a meteoroid.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "09bf46944e21365c1b93791bf5ed78332bc8b5253c8f410e02c071f7f1da3ede"
        },
        {
